WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Every project starts with an idea.

00:04.500 --> 00:10.000
You don't need a perfect brief. Tell T.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.500
Turn a rough thought into a clear plan.

00:16.500 --> 00:23.000
Follow the work as it happens.

00:23.000 --> 00:29.500
Open something you can see and use.

00:29.500 --> 00:35.000
Keep talking. Keep making it yours.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Your idea. Let's make it together.
